  "body": "Often admired and seldom available, this exceptional beachside apartment delivers an enviable coastal lifestyle in one of Orewa's most sought-after waterfront locations. Positioned on the ground floor within the prestigious beachfront Ocean Point residences with sea views, this luxurious apartment enjoys generous house-sized proportions.\r\n\r\nDesigned for effortless living and entertaining, the designer chef's kitchen is the heart of the home, complete with a spacious butler's pantry and premium European appliances. The expansive open-plan living area extends seamlessly to a substantial covered deck enclosed with glass sliders, creating the perfect setting for year-round entertaining while maximising the stunning beachside outlook.\r\n\r\nOffering exceptional accommodation, the apartment comprises two generous bedrooms, a dedicated study, and two beautifully appointed bathrooms. With ample space for family and guests, this residence strikes the perfect balance between luxury, comfort, and practicality.\r\n\r\nEnjoy the ease of a lock-up-and-leave lifestyle with premium features including lift access directly from two secure basement car parks and a private storage locker, double glazing, and ducted air conditioning.\r\n\r\nWhether you are taking a morning stroll along the golden sands of Orewa Beach, stepping from the property to the shoreline, or unwinding beside the resort-style swimming pool and spa, every day feels like a holiday.\r\n\r\nOcean Point is an exclusive boutique complex of just 28 apartments, offering a welcoming community and an outstanding lifestyle opportunity for families, professionals, retirees, or those seeking the ultimate coastal retreat.\r\n\r\nJust a short, level walk from vibrant Orewa township, you'll enjoy easy access to an array of cafes, restaurants, shops, and everyday amenities. For those seeking luxury beachfront living with the convenience of easy access to Auckland, this outstanding residence presents a rare and highly desirable opportunity.",
